    "physical_description": "Head cloth of cotton batik. Dyed fabric using the wax-resist process in blue, brown and cream. The field is patterned with a parang (broken dagger) motif. The centre of the field is broken by a modang (lozenge) in blue bordered with a frieze of small stylised leaves (tjekmukirran). The cloth is bordered with a narrow band of blue eyelets surrounded by brown lines.",
